Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:35.70,0:01:37.05,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}早安，真嗣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:37.05,0:01:38.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}感觉怎么样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:38.35,0:01:41.50,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}已经习惯了，我想应该还不错…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:41.55,0:01:42.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那就好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:42.90,0:01:45.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}EVA 的射出口、紧急用电源
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:45.40,0:01:47.90,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}武装大楼配置、回收地点
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:47.90,0:01:49.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}全都记住了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:49.80,0:01:50.50,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}大概…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:50.50,0:01:52.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那么，再温习一次吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:52.50,0:01:56.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}通常 EVA 由有线供给的电力运转
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:56.80,0:01:59.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}紧急状况下使用体内电源的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:59.00,0:02:01.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}由于电池容量的关系只能运行 1 分钟
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:01.80,0:02:05.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}就算利用增益，最多也只能运行 5 分钟
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:05.40,0:02:08.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这就是我们的科学极限
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:08.40,0:02:09.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}懂了吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:09.80,0:02:10.50,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:10.50,0:02:13.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那么继续昨天的诱导模式（Induction Mode）了哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:10.50,0:02:13.80,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(050,100)}* 扳机优先模式：不以脑波同步，而以枪械操作为优先的模式
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:19.00,0:02:22.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}将目标放入中心，按下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:26.10,0:02:28.90,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}冷静点，将目标放入中心
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:28.90,0:02:29.50,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}按…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:34.70,0:02:35.30,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}下一个
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:44.40,0:02:48.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}没想到真嗣还真愿意做呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:48.00,0:02:50.30,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}顺从别人说的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:50.30,0:02:52.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那不就是他的处世之道嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:57.00,0:02:59.50,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}将目标放入中心，按…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:00.70,0:03:03.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}将目标放入中心，按…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:04.20,0:03:06.20,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}将目标放入中心，按…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:07.60,0:03:09.50,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}将目标放入中心，按…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:11.30,0:03:13.30,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}将目标放入中心…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:17.89,0:03:21.10,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(050,050)}那么，镜头从演播室切换到松崎的篠原夏子小姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:21.70,0:03:25.04,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(050,050)}是！各位早上好，我是篠原
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:25.45,0:03:29.25,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(050,050)}今天我可是来西伊豆的松崎潜水的哟
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:29.55,0:03:32.10,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(050,050)}今天伊豆、箱根地区天气晴朗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:32.10,0:03:35.80,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(050,050)}预测最高温度比常年值高 2 度，为 30 度
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:35.90,0:03:38.30,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(050,050)}今天虽然也和一年中的其它日子一样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:38.40,0:03:40.90,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(050,050)}持续着炎热的天气
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:41.00,0:03:44.70,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(050,050)}不过过去日本也是有春夏秋冬四季的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:44.80,0:03:46.80,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(050,050)}现在虽然看不到雪
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:46.90,0:03:50.70,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(050,050)}但因为这炎热的天气海洋生物数量有少许回复
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:50.80,0:03:53.40,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(050,050)}只要实际的潜水看看就能明白
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:53.50,0:03:54.90,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(050,050)}鱼儿很多很多
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:55.00,0:03:58.20,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(050,050)}今晚要是吃这个该多好啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:58.80,0:04:01.70,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(050,050)}虽然看到沉在水中的街道让我感到有点悲伤…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:30.20,0:03:31.60,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那个…美里小姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:31.60,0:03:33.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}已经天亮了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:34.80,0:03:37.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我刚刚才值完班
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:37.50,0:03:40.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}今天傍晚前去报到就可以了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:40.30,0:03:42.50,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}所以让我睡吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:42.80,0:03:44.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那么…我…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:45.20,0:03:47.20,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}今天是星期四吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:47.20,0:03:49.50,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}可燃垃圾就拜托了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:50.60,0:03:51.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}是…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:52.30,0:03:55.50,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}学校那边都习惯了吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:55.50,0:03:56.20,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}嗯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:57.00,0:03:59.70,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}哦…慢走
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:59.70,0:04:00.70,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我走了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:16.00,0:04:18.50,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}是…喂
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:18.50,0:04:20.60,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}什么呀，是律子啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:20.60,0:04:23.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}怎么样？和他相处还好吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:23.40,0:04:24.60,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}他
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:25.40,0:04:26.90,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}…真嗣啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:26.90,0:04:29.70,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}转学两个星期了，还是老样子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:29.70,0:04:32.50,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}到现在好像都还没有人打过电话来找他
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:32.50,0:04:33.30,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}电话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:33.80,0:04:35.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}因为是必需品…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:35.10,0:04:38.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}所以我之前就给他手机了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:38.00,0:04:39.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}但是他自己都没有在用
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:39.40,0:04:42.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}好像也没有人打来给他
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:43.50,0:04:44.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那孩子…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:44.80,0:04:47.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}该不会没有朋友吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:47.00,0:04:52.50,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}真嗣的性格也许不适于交朋友吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:52.50,0:04:55.50,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你知道“豪猪的距离”吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:55.50,0:04:58.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}豪猪？那种浑身是刺的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:58.40,0:05:02.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}豪猪虽然想将自己的温暖传给对方
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:02.30,0:05:03.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}但是身体只要靠的越近
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:03.80,0:05:07.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}全身的刺就越会使对方受伤
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:07.00,0:05:09.20,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}人类也是这样的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:09.20,0:05:13.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}现在的真嗣也因为内心某处害怕伤痛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:13.00,0:05:15.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}而变得胆小了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:15.00,0:05:17.15,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}过不久他就会注意到的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:17.15,0:05:18.60,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}所谓的成长
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:18.80,0:05:21.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}就是经过不断的聚散离合
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:21.80,0:05:26.30,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}找到不太会伤害到彼此的距离
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:39.70,0:05:41.50,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}有什么事吗，班长
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:41.50,0:05:43.70,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}昨天的讲义已经帮我送去了吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:46.90,0:05:50.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不…不知道为什么冬二家都没人在
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:50.10,0:05:53.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}相田，你不是跟铃原很要好吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:53.10,0:05:55.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}他两个星期都没来你不担心吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:56.00,0:05:57.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不会是受了重伤吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:57.80,0:05:59.90,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}唉？因为那个机器人事件吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:00.20,0:06:02.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}但是电视不是说没人受伤吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:02.10,0:06:03.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}怎么可能
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:03.10,0:06:05.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}鹰巢山的爆炸中心区，你看到了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:06.20,0:06:08.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不仅是入间和小松
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:08.40,0:06:11.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}就连三泽和九州的部队也出动了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:11.40,0:06:15.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}绝对不止十几二十个，死了人也…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:17.70,0:06:18.70,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}冬二
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:18.70,0:06:19.50,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}铃原
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:21.20,0:06:24.30,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}看来好像少了不少人嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:24.40,0:06:26.20,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}疏散啦、疏散
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:26.20,0:06:28.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}大家都转学了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:28.10,0:06:31.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}在城里发生了那么激烈的战事啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:31.20,0:06:35.90,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}会高兴的大概只有你吧，因为能看到战场
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:35.90,0:06:40.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}还好啦，冬二你怎么了？缺席了这么久
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:40.00,0:06:43.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}该不会是因为骚动而受到连累吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:43.90,0:06:45.60,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我妹妹她…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:47.10,0:06:50.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我妹妹她被压在瓦砾下…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:50.50,0:06:54.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}性命是保住了，却要一直住在医院
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:54.50,0:06:57.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我爸爸和爷爷都在研究所工作
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:58.30,0:07:00.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}又不能离开工作场所
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:01.20,0:07:02.30,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}如果我不在的话…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:02.30,0:07:05.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}她就要孤单一人在医院了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:05.00,0:07:08.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不过，那个机器人的驾驶员还真差劲
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:08.80,0:07:10.70,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}想了就火大
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:10.70,0:07:13.50,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}自家人还发飙那还得了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:13.50,0:07:14.70,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}关于这件事
